---
// ValueProposition.astro
---
<section id="about" class="relative py-20 bg-brand-charcoal border-y border-white/5 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Decorative background geometric divider line -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-brand-gold/40 to-transparent"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-brand-gold/40 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-xs text-brand-gold uppercase tracking-widest">Why Partner With Navkar</h2>
      <p class="font-display font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Engineered for International Standards & Unmatched Reliability
      </p>
      <div class="h-1 w-16 bg-brand-gold mx-auto mt-4"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid Columns -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Global Compliance -->
      <div class="group relative bg-brand-dark/50 border border-white/5 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-gold/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-[2px] h-0 bg-brand-gold group-hover:h-full transition-all duration-500"></div>
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex p-3 bg-brand-charcoal border border-white/10 text-brand-gold group-hover:bg-brand-gold group-hover:text-brand-dark transition-all duration-350">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors duration-300">
          Global Compliance & Standards
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-light/65 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Every component complies with strict European norms (EN 81-70, EN 81-20), CE benchmarks, and ISO 9001 regulations. We guarantee seamless safety approval globally.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Precision Manufacturing -->
      <div class="group relative bg-brand-dark/50 border border-white/5 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-gold/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-[2px] h-0 bg-brand-gold group-hover:h-full transition-all duration-500"></div>
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex p-3 bg-brand-charcoal border border-white/10 text-brand-gold group-hover:bg-brand-gold group-hover:text-brand-dark transition-all duration-350">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors duration-300">
          Precision Manufacturing
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-light/65 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Leveraging state-of-the-art automated CNC machinery, fiber laser cutting, and microscopic tolerance calibration (&lt;0.02mm) to produce perfect components every time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Custom Engineering Support -->
      <div class="group relative bg-brand-dark/50 border border-white/5 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-gold/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-[2px] h-0 bg-brand-gold group-hover:h-full transition-all duration-500"></div>
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex p-3 bg-brand-charcoal border border-white/10 text-brand-gold group-hover:bg-brand-gold group-hover:text-brand-dark transition-all duration-350">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors duration-300">
          Custom Engineering Support
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-light/65 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Our specialized R&D team partners with you to develop bespoke layouts, custom tactile typography, custom sizes, unique steel finishes, and complex wiring integrations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Fast International Shipping -->
      <div class="group relative bg-brand-dark/50 border border-white/5 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-gold/40 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-[2px] h-0 bg-brand-gold group-hover:h-full transition-all duration-500"></div>
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex p-3 bg-brand-charcoal border border-white/10 text-brand-gold group-hover:bg-brand-gold group-hover:text-brand-dark transition-all duration-350">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 002 2h2.5M10.4 21V16.2a1.8 1.8 0 01.8-1.5l3.8-2.6a.5.5 0 00.2-.4V8.5" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-white mb-3 group-hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors duration-300">
          Fast International Shipping
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-light/65 leading-relaxed font-light">
          Global supply chain partnerships ensure secure container packing, optimized freight forwarding, customs documentation handling, and tracking to your facility door.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
